# Single Assistant card

Futura Nota is moving toward one protagonist: **Asistente**.

## Transition

- Keep the existing **Agents** folder/card untouched while testing continues.
- Do not delete or migrate Agents until the user explicitly approves it.
- Add a separate card directly below Agents titled **Asistente**.
- The new card should follow the current Agent card's insert/open interaction so it can be inserted into the workspace.
- Long term, Agents will be removed and only Asistente will remain.

## Chat reference

Primary in-doc shell (Call Asistente / Gina):

- Saved: `.cursor/saved/gina-chat-card/` (`AIChatCard.original.tsx` + adapted `GinaChatCard.jsx` + CSS)
- Open from a **button inside the open document**; motion chat card with bubbles, typing, Enter/send.
- Dark surface base `#151515`. Header = Gina / Asistente identity (not “AI Assistant” / Nexus).
- Adapt to this repo’s JSX, CSS, i18n, state; do **not** assume shadcn `cn` or `lucide-react` (not in package.json — framer-motion is OK).
- Demo/stub replies only until Gina tools are wired.

## Product direction

- Start text-first.
- Voice comes later for small tasks.
- Schedule/status signals help Asistente take smarter notes and manage reminders.
- **Functional brief is now explicit:** Gina system v2 — see `gina-assistant-system.mdc` and `.cursor/saved/gina-system/BRIEF.md`.
- Still phase AI/Claude connection; ship reminder capture + To Do/UI before live model calls.
